## Como usar

1. Use os arquivos individuais para testar módulos específicos
2. Ou use este arquivo para ter acesso a todos os endpoints em um só lugar
3. Veja README.md para mais informações sobre o fluxo de teste

## Resumo de Endpoints

### Autenticação
- POST /login
- POST /logout
- GET /api/user

### Utils
- GET /api/utils/check

### Teams
- GET /api/team/
- GET /api/team/{id}/detail
- GET /api/team/{id}/current
- POST /api/team
- PUT /api/team/{id}
- DELETE /api/team/{id}

### Players
- GET /api/player
- GET /api/player/{id}
- GET /api/players/analytic
- POST /api/player
- PUT /api/player/change-team
- DELETE /api/player/{id}

### Championships
- GET /api/championship/{id}
- GET /api/championship/{id}/fixtures
- GET /api/championship/{id}/awards
- POST /api/championship
- PUT /api/championship/{id}
- POST /api/championship/{id}/generate-final-round
- DELETE /api/championship/{id}

### Championship Analytics
- GET /api/championship/standings/{id}
- GET /api/championship/players-stats/{id}
- GET /api/championship/team-stats/{id}
- GET /api/championship/table-data/{id}
- POST /api/championship/clashes

### Fixtures
- GET /api/fixtures/{id}
- GET /api/fixtures/{id}/basic
- GET /api/fixtures/{id}/unplayed
- PUT /api/fixtures/
